ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nChen Wei is a college student in Guangdong. One year, bird flu spreads in Guangdong, and in the supermarket outside the university, large New Orleans roast chicken sells at half price, less than ten yuan, Chen Wei excitedly buys one. When he checks out, the aunt behind him asks him: \"Young man, do you know what the latest news is?\"\n\n[Question]\nWhat does the aunt really want to say when she says this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. The aunt is casually chatting, wanting to know the latest happenings.\nB. The aunt wants to point out that the price of New Orleans roast chicken is too cheap.\nC. The aunt wants to ask Chen Wei about his views on political news.\nD. The aunt implies that it is unsafe to buy roast chicken during the bird flu season.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001032211529485603,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52abec2ddb05a7fe2ecef","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452158627,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:55:58","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"9775f5b5ca2241f8b757cdfd8c84268f"}